  "transcript": "Here's the part the sign hides, what you actually spend. 50% off, you wanted one thing, you paid five, done. By one, get one free to get the free one. You first coughed up the full 10. You spent twice as much in one trip, and you carried home a second when you did not need. That is the whole game. 50% off is a smaller price. By one, get one free is a bigger basket. One saves your money, the other spends it, and smiles at you while it robs you. If you only wanted one, half price was the better deal. You walked right past it because the other sign said the magic word.",
